      "Notes", CellID -> 1581524779], 
     Cell[TextData[{"The order-zero element is the Hamiltonian. No ", 
        Cell[BoxData[FormBox[TagBox["\[HBar]", HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], 
         "InlineMath", ScriptLevel -> 0, FractionBoxOptions -> 
          {BaseStyle -> {ScriptLevel -> 0}}], " factors are inserted."}], 
      "Notes", CellID -> 953812405], 
     Cell[TextData[
